    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="python可视化-折线图">Python可视化-折线图</h1>
<h2 id="一-json-数据处理">（一） <strong>JSON 数据处理</strong></h2>
<h4 id="1json-简介">（1）<strong>JSON 简介</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>定义</strong>：JSON（JavaScript Object Notation）是一种轻量级的数据交互格式，采用文本格式存储和表示数据。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="2json-转换">（2）<strong>JSON 转换</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>将 Python 数据转换为 JSON</strong>：</p>
<ul>
<li>使用 <code>json.dumps()</code> 方法。</li>
<li>如果有中文，可以设置 <code>ensure_ascii=False</code> 确保中文正常转换。</li>
<li><strong>语法</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>json_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> json<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>dumps(python_data, ensure_ascii<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#66d9ef">False</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong>示例</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#f92672">import</span> json
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> {<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;name&#34;</span>: <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;张三&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;age&#34;</span>: <span style="color:#ae81ff">25</span>}
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>json_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> json<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>dumps(data, ensure_ascii<span style="color:#f92672">=</span><span style="color:#66d9ef">False</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(json_data)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 {&#34;name&#34;: &#34;张三&#34;, &#34;age&#34;: 25}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>将 JSON 转换为 Python 数据</strong>：</p>
<ul>
<li>使用 <code>json.loads()</code> 方法。</li>
<li><strong>语法</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>python_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> json<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>loads(json_data)
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong>示例</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>json_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;{&#34;name&#34;: &#34;张三&#34;, &#34;age&#34;: 25}&#39;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> json<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>loads(json_data)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(data)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 {&#39;name&#39;: &#39;张三&#39;, &#39;age&#39;: 25}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="二-pyecharts-数据可视化">（二） <strong><code>pyecharts</code> 数据可视化</strong></h2>
<h3 id="1pyecharts-简介">1、<strong><code>pyecharts</code> 简介</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>定义</strong>：<code>pyecharts</code> 是一个基于 ECharts 的 Python 数据可视化库。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>Python异常、模块与包</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E4%B8%8E%E5%8C%85/</link>
    <pubDate>Sat, 15 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E4%B8%8E%E5%8C%85/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="python异常模块与包">Python异常、模块与包</h1>
<h2 id="一异常">（一）异常</h2>
<h3 id="1-异常的概念">1. <strong>异常的概念</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>异常</strong>：程序运行过程中出现的错误。</li>
<li><strong>Bug</strong>：指程序中的异常或错误，源于历史上因小虫子导致计算机失灵的案例。</li>
<li><strong>异常的影响</strong>：
<ul>
<li>程序可能因异常停止运行（崩溃）。</li>
<li>通过捕获异常，可以让程序在出现异常时继续运行。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="2-捕获异常">2. <strong>捕获异常</strong></h3>
<h4 id="1基本语法">（1）<strong>基本语法</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>作用</strong>：提前假设某处会出现异常，并做好处理准备。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>语法</strong>：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    可能发生错误的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    如果出现异常执行的代码
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h4 id="2捕获指定异常">（2）<strong>捕获指定异常</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>作用</strong>：捕获特定类型的异常。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>语法</strong>：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    可能发生错误的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> 异常类型 <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    处理异常的代码
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h4 id="3捕获多个异常">（3）<strong>捕获多个异常</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li><strong>作用</strong>：捕获多种类型的异常。</li>
<li><strong>语法</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    可能发生错误的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> (异常类型1, 异常类型2) <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    处理异常的代码
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong>示例</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(num)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 可能抛出 NameError</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span> <span style="color:#f92672">/</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">0</span>)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 可能抛出 ZeroDivisionError</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> (<span style="color:#a6e22e">NameError</span>, <span style="color:#a6e22e">ZeroDivisionError</span>) <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;捕获到异常:&#34;</span>, e)
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h4 id="4捕获所有异常">（4）<strong>捕获所有异常</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>作用</strong>：捕获所有类型的异常。</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>语法</strong>：</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    可能发生错误的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">Exception</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    处理异常的代码
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h4 id="5else-和-finally">（5）<strong><code>else</code> 和 <code>finally</code></strong></h4>
<ul>
<li><strong><code>else</code></strong>：当没有异常时执行的代码。</li>
<li><strong><code>finally</code></strong>：无论是否发生异常，都会执行的代码（如关闭文件）。</li>
<li><strong>语法</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    可能发生错误的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">Exception</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    处理异常的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    没有异常时执行的代码
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">finally</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    无论是否异常都会执行的代码
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li><strong>示例</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    f <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> open(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;test.txt&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;r&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">Exception</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;捕获到异常:&#34;</span>, e)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;没有异常，真开心&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">finally</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    f<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>close()
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h3 id="3-异常的传递性">3. <strong>异常的传递性</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>定义</strong>：当函数中发生异常且未被捕获时，异常会传递给调用该函数的代码，直到被捕获或程序崩溃。</li>
<li><strong>特点</strong>：
<ul>
<li>异常会从内层函数向外层函数传递。</li>
<li>如果所有函数都未捕获异常，程序会崩溃。</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>示例</strong>：
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">func01</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span> <span style="color:#f92672">/</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">0</span>)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 抛出 ZeroDivisionError</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">func02</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    func01()  <span style="color:#75715e"># 异常传递到 func02</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">main</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">try</span>:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        func02()  <span style="color:#75715e"># 异常传递到 main</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">except</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">Exception</span> <span style="color:#66d9ef">as</span> e:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;捕获到异常:&#34;</span>, e)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>main()  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 &#34;捕获到异常: division by zero&#34;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="二模块">（二）模块</h2>
<h3 id="1-模块的概念">1. <strong>模块的概念</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>定义</strong>：模块是一个 Python 文件（以 <code>.py</code> 结尾），包含类、函数、变量等，可以被其他 Python 程序导入和使用。</li>
<li><strong>作用</strong>：
<ul>
<li>将代码组织成可重用的单元。</li>
<li>提供工具包，帮助快速实现功能（如 <code>time</code> 模块用于时间操作）。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="2-导入模块">2. <strong>导入模块</strong></h3>
<h4 id="1基本语法-1">（1）<strong>基本语法</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong><code>import</code> 语句</strong>：</p>]]></description>
