<item>
    <title>Python数据容器</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python-%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python-%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%AE%B9%E5%99%A8/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="python数据容器">Python数据容器</h1>
<p>Python 中的数据容器是用于<strong>存储和管理数据</strong>的对象。常见的数据容器包括<strong>列表（<code>list</code>）、元组（<code>tuple</code>）、字符串（<code>str</code>）、集合（<code>set</code>）和字典（<code>dict</code>）</strong>。</p>
<h3 id="一-数据容器list列表">（一） <strong>数据容器：<code>list</code>（列表）</strong></h3>
<p><strong>1、定义</strong>：</p>
<ul>
<li>列表是一种<strong>有序</strong>、可变的数据容器，可以存储<strong>任意类型</strong>的元素</li>
<li>元素<strong>可以重复</strong>、支持<strong>增删改查</strong>操作</li>
<li>列表可以一次存储多个数据，且可以为<strong>不同的数据类型（混装）</strong>，支持嵌套</li>
<li>下标支持从前往后（正数）、从后往前（负数）</li>
</ul>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>列表名 <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> [元素1, 元素2, <span style="color:#f92672">...</span>]
</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2、<code>list</code> 的遍历</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>方法 1：使用 <code>for</code> 循环</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> fruit <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> fruits:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(fruit)
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li>
<p><strong>方法 2：使用索引</strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> i <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> range(len(fruits)):
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(fruits[i])
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
<li>
<p><strong>方法 3：使用 <code>enumerate()</code></strong></p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> index, fruit <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> enumerate(fruits):
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    print(<span style="color:#e6db74">f</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;Index: </span><span style="color:#e6db74">{</span>index<span style="color:#e6db74">}</span><span style="color:#e6db74">, Fruit: </span><span style="color:#e6db74">{</span>fruit<span style="color:#e6db74">}</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h4 id="3列表常用操作">3、列表常用操作</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 定义一个列表</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> [<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;apple&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;banana&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;cherry&#34;</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 1. 追加元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>append(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;orange&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;追加后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;banana&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 2. 扩展列表</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>extend([<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;grape&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;mango&#34;</span>])
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;扩展后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;banana&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;, &#39;grape&#39;, &#39;mango&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 3. 插入元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>insert(<span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;pear&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;插入后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;pear&#39;, &#39;banana&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;, &#39;grape&#39;, &#39;mango&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 4. 删除元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">del</span> fruits[<span style="color:#ae81ff">2</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;删除后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;pear&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;, &#39;grape&#39;, &#39;mango&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 5. 弹出元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>removed_fruit <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>pop(<span style="color:#ae81ff">3</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;弹出后:&#34;</span>, fruits)        <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;pear&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;grape&#39;, &#39;mango&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;弹出的元素:&#34;</span>, removed_fruit)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 orange</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 6. 移除元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>remove(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;pear&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;移除后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;grape&#39;, &#39;mango&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 7. 清空列表</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>clear()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;清空后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 []</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 8. 统计元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> [<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;apple&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;banana&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;cherry&#34;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;banana&#34;</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>count <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>count(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;banana&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;banana 出现的次数:&#34;</span>, count)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 2</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 9. 查找元素下标</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>index <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>index(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;cherry&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;cherry 的下标:&#34;</span>, index)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 2</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 10. 获取列表长度</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>length <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> len(fruits)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;列表长度:&#34;</span>, length)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 4</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 11. 修改元素</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits[<span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span>] <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;orange&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;修改后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;apple&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;banana&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 12. 反转列表</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>fruits<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>reverse()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;反转后:&#34;</span>, fruits)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;banana&#39;, &#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;, &#39;apple&#39;]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 13. 排序列表</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>numbers <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> [<span style="color:#ae81ff">3</span>, <span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span>, <span style="color:#ae81ff">4</span>, <span style="color:#ae81ff">2</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>numbers<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>sort()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;排序后:&#34;</span>, numbers)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [1, 2, 3, 4]</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 14. 切片操作</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>subset <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> fruits[<span style="color:#ae81ff">1</span>:<span style="color:#ae81ff">3</span>]
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;切片后:&#34;</span>, subset)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 [&#39;cherry&#39;, &#39;orange&#39;]</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id="二数据容器tuple元组">（二）<strong>数据容器：<code>tuple</code>（元组）</strong></h3>
<p><strong>1、定义</strong>：元组是一种<strong>有序、不可变</strong>的数据容器。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>Python文件操作</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python-%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python-%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h1 id="python文件操作">Python文件操作</h1>
<h2 id="一编码">（一）编码</h2>
<h3 id="1-编码的概念">1. <strong>编码的概念</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>定义</strong>：编码是一种将 <strong>可识别内容</strong>（如文字、符号等）转换为 <strong>二进制数据</strong> 的规则，同时也定义了如何将二进制数据转换回可识别内容。</li>
<li><strong>作用</strong>：
<ul>
<li>存储：将人类可读的内容转换为计算机可存储的二进制数据。</li>
<li>传输：在网络传输中，编码确保数据能够正确传递和解析。</li>
<li>显示：将二进制数据转换回人类可读的内容。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id="2-常见编码">2. <strong>常见编码</strong></h3>
<h4 id="1utf-8">（1）<strong>UTF-8</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>是一种 <strong>可变长度</strong> 的 Unicode 编码。</li>
<li>支持全球所有语言的字符。</li>
<li>兼容 ASCII 编码。</li>
</ul>
<h5 id="2gbk">（2）<strong>GBK</strong></h5>
<ul>
<li>是一种针对 <strong>中文</strong> 的编码。</li>
<li>支持简体中文和繁体中文。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="3big5">（3）<strong>Big5</strong></h4>
<ul>
<li>是一种针对 <strong>繁体中文</strong> 的编码。</li>
<li>主要用于台湾、香港等地区。</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id="3-编码与解码">3. <strong>编码与解码</strong></h3>
<h5 id="1编码encode">（1）<strong>编码（Encode）</strong></h5>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>作用</strong>：将字符串转换为二进制数据。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>字符串<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>encode(编码格式)
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>text <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;我喜欢你&#34;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>binary_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> text<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>encode(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;UTF-8&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(binary_data)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 b&#39;\xe6\x88\x91\xe5\x96\x9c\xe6\xac\xa2\xe4\xbd\xa0&#39;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<h5 id="2解码decode">（2）<strong>解码（Decode）</strong></h5>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>作用</strong>：将二进制数据转换为字符串。</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>二进制数据<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>decode(编码格式)
</span></span></code></pre></div><div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>binary_data <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#e6db74">b</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;</span><span style="color:#ae81ff">\xe6\x88\x91\xe5\x96\x9c\xe6\xac\xa2\xe4\xbd\xa0</span><span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>text <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> binary_data<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>decode(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;UTF-8&#34;</span>)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(text)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出 &#34;我喜欢你&#34;</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h3 id="4-编码错误的处理">4. <strong>编码错误的处理</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>常见错误</strong>：
<ul>
<li><code>UnicodeEncodeError</code>：编码时无法将字符转换为指定编码。</li>
<li><code>UnicodeDecodeError</code>：解码时无法将二进制数据转换为指定编码的字符。</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>解决方法</strong>：
<ul>
<li>使用 <code>errors</code> 参数指定错误处理方式。
<ul>
<li><code>ignore</code>：忽略无法编码/解码的字符。</li>
<li><code>replace</code>：用替代字符（如 <code>?</code>）替换无法编码/解码的字符。</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="heading"></h4>
<h2 id="二文件操作">（二）文件操作</h2>
<h3 id="1-打开文件">1. <strong>打开文件</strong></h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>open(file, mode, encoding)
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li>
<p><code>file</code>：文件路径（字符串类型）。</p>]]></description>
</item>
<item>
    <title>python面试题1</title>
    <link>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</link>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Mar 2025 00:00:00 &#43;0000</pubDate>
    <author>Jinxiwei</author>
    <guid>https://jinxiwei1230.github.io/Jinxiwei.github.io/posts/python%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</guid>
    <description><![CDATA[<h3 id="1python-中的三元表达式">1、Python 中的三元表达式</h3>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>[on_true] <span style="color:#66d9ef">if</span> [expression] <span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span> [on_false]
</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>
<li><code>[expression]</code> 是一个布尔表达式，结果为 <code>True</code> 或 <code>False</code>。</li>
<li>如果 <code>[expression]</code> 为 <code>True</code>，则整个表达式的结果是 <code>[on_true]</code>。</li>
<li>如果 <code>[expression]</code> 为 <code>False</code>，则整个表达式的结果是 <code>[on_false]</code>。</li>
</ul>
<h4 id="例子">例子：</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span>x <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">10</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>y <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> <span style="color:#ae81ff">20</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 使用三元表达式选择较大的值</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>max_value <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> x <span style="color:#66d9ef">if</span> x <span style="color:#f92672">&gt;</span> y <span style="color:#66d9ef">else</span> y
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(max_value)  <span style="color:#75715e"># 输出: 20</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在这个例子中，<code>x &gt; y</code> 是 <code>False</code>，所以 <code>max_value</code> 被赋值为 <code>y</code>，即 <code>20</code>。</p>
<h3 id="2python-中如何实现多线程">2、Python 中如何实现多线程？</h3>
<p>Python 中的多线程可以通过 <code>threading</code> 模块来实现。线程是轻量级的进程，多线程允许程序同时执行多个任务。然而，由于 Python 的全局解释器锁（GIL），多线程在 CPU 密集型任务中并不能真正实现并行执行，但在 I/O 密集型任务中仍然有用。</p>
<h4 id="使用-threading-模块实现多线程">使用 <code>threading</code> 模块实现多线程</h4>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" style="color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;"><code class="language-python" data-lang="python"><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#f92672">import</span> threading
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">print_numbers</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> i <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> range(<span style="color:#ae81ff">5</span>):
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        print(i)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#66d9ef">def</span> <span style="color:#a6e22e">print_letters</span>():
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>    <span style="color:#66d9ef">for</span> letter <span style="color:#f92672">in</span> [<span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;a&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;b&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;c&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;d&#39;</span>, <span style="color:#e6db74">&#39;e&#39;</span>]:
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>        print(letter)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 创建线程</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1 <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> threading<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>Thread(target<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>print_numbers)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2 <span style="color:#f92672">=</span> threading<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>Thread(target<span style="color:#f92672">=</span>print_letters)
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 启动线程</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>start()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>start()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span><span style="color:#75715e"># 等待线程完成</span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread1<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>join()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>thread2<span style="color:#f92672">.</span>join()
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>
</span></span><span style="display:flex;"><span>print(<span style="color:#e6db74">&#34;多线程执行完毕&#34;</span>)
</span></span></code></pre></div><ol>
<li>
<p><strong>GIL（全局解释器锁）</strong>：Python 的 GIL 确保同一时间只有一个线程执行 Python 字节码。这意味着即使在多核 CPU 上，Python 的多线程也不能真正并行执行 CPU 密集型任务。GIL 的存在是为了保护 Python 解释器的内部数据结构不被多个线程同时修改。</p>]]></description>
